s\\\\\\\" en `main-ci-deploy.yml`\\\\n2. Comando: `pytest tests/ -v --tb=short --maxfail=10 -m \\\\\\\"not integration and not slow\\\\\\\"`\\\\n3. Sin `continue-on-error: true` — debe bloquear el deploy si hay fallos\\\\n4. Verificar que `DATABASE_URL` esté disponible en el env del step\\\\n\\\\n**Criterio de aceptación:**\\\\n- Step \\\\\\\"Run unit tests\\\\\\\" habilitado y corriendo en cada push a main\\\\n- Push con tests fallando bloquea el deploy a QA y notifica Telegram\\\\n- Push con tests pasando despliega a QA normalmente\\\\n\\\\n**Archivos relevantes:**\\\\n- `.github/workflows/main-ci-deploy.yml` — step comentado ~líneas 47-55\\\\n- `pytest.ini` — markers: slow, integration, api, vision\\\\n\\\\n**Fuera de scope:** no modificar los tests, no tocar main-ci.yml (ticket separado QuantAgent-ng1).\\\\n\\\\n**Bloqueado por:** QuantAgent-sfc, QuantAgent-4ch\\\\n\\\",\\n      \\\"notes\\\": \\\"Bloqueado por QuantAgent-sfc (SQLite/JSONB) y QuantAgent-4ch (test failures)\\\",\\n      \\\"status\\\": \\\"blocked\\\",\\n      \\\"priority\\\": 2,\\n      \\\"issue_type\\\": \\\"task\\\",\\n      \\\"owner\\\": \\\"fscheu@gmail.com\\\",\\n      \\\"created_at\\\": \\\"2026-04-21T02:12:55.425651305Z\\\",\\n      \\\"created_by\\\": \\\"Federico Scheu\\\",\\n      \\\"updated_at\\\": \\\"2026-05-07T01:55:15.494360563Z\\\",\\n      \\\"labels\\\": [\\n        \\\"openclaw:blocked_by:QuantAgent-4ch\\\",\\n        \\\"openclaw:blocked_by:QuantAgent-sfc\\\",\\n        \\\"openclaw:design_approved ci\\\"\\n      ],\\n      \\\"dependency_type\\\": \\\"blocks\\\"\\n    }\\n  ]\\n}\",\"numLines\":33,\"startLine\":1,\"totalLines\":33}}}\ndocs/envelopes/QuantAgent-uz9/20260507T174143Z-QuantAgent-uz9-implementer/executor-stdout-claude-code.log:62:{\"type\":\"user\",\"message\":{\"role\":\"user\",\"content\":[{\"tool_use_id\":\"toolu_01MgRAbei26LmBM2d9ju1dFf\",\"type\":\"tool_result\",\"content\":\"1\\t# Deploy Verification — GitHub Actions Webhook\\n2\\t\\n3\\t**Timestamp:**